Package: judgeaudit
Type: Package
Title: Design and Analysis of Human Gold-Standard Audits of AI Judges
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Prabhu", "Rangaraju",
           email = "prabhu.evals@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-1861-1401"))
Description: Design how many human labels are needed to audit an
    'LLM-as-judge' or AI annotator against human gold labels, analyse
    agreement (Cohen's kappa, sensitivity and specificity) with
    confidence intervals, and compute Rogan-Gladen
    misclassification-adjusted prevalence with propagated uncertainty.
    The package never calls a language model: it works offline on
    labels the user already has.
